# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 🔒 Telegram credentials & sessions — NEVER commit these.
# A .session file or TELEGRAM_SESSION_STRING grants full access
# to a Telegram account. These patterns must stay ignored forever.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.session
*_telethon.session
*session*.session
TELEGRAM_*
*.tdata*
*tdata.zip

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 🔒 Build artifacts — the CI zip must never be tracked (rule #7:
# artifacts can contain workspace state; rebuilt by ci_check.py).
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
token-diet-lib.zip
state/
logs/
memory/
*_telethon.session
*_telethon(1).session
*.jsonl.bak
incoming_feed.jsonl
aliases.json
.telegram-mcp/
mcp_errors.log

# Tinkoff Invest API token (never commit!)
.tinkoff/
*.token
~/.sudo_pass
